/* ==========================================================================
* ATLAS V2 microSD high-rate flight recorder
* ==========================================================================
*
* One power-up creates one new FLTxxxx.BIN file.
* Existing files are never overwritten.
*
* File layout:
*   128-byte SDLogHeader_t
*   followed by fixed 64-byte SDLogRecord_t records.
*
* Record types are independent so each sensor group can be logged at the
* rate that makes sense for it without wasting space.
*
* Current bring-up rates:
*   IMU1 + IMU2        200 Hz
*   ADXL372 high-G     500 Hz
*   Barometer           10 Hz
*   GPS                  4 Hz
*   Battery/continuity   10 Hz
*/
